- an entry () -> waitClicks(val(null), val(null), val(null), ...): the wait, the x of the clicks, then the y of each click
- an entry () -> region(val(null), val(null), val(null), val(null)) for action tileArea: x, y, width and height of the part of the screen the next check of the test compares, here the tile: `printf '69\n95\n128\n85\n;\n' > /data/pilot_<desk>/channel/tileArea`
- a text value is quoted: "hello"
